{"id":67553,"date":"2025-10-06T07:57:29","date_gmt":"2025-10-06T06:57:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67553"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:49:25","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:49:25","slug":"carcavelos-xmas-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/carcavelos-xmas-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Carcavelos X-Mas Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Carcavelos X-Mas Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Carcavelos X-Mas Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na pitoresca aldeia de <strong>Carcavelos de Lousa<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Loures<\/strong> e distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovido pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa de Carcavelos de Lousa (ARCL)<\/strong>, este evento de trail running natal\u00edcio convida atletas e caminheiros a explorar os deslumbrantes trilhos rurais e encostas florestais da regi\u00e3o saloia, com partida e chegada instaladas na sede da associa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa competitivo divide-se pelo desafiante <strong>Trail Curto de 19 km<\/strong> e pelo veloz <strong>Mini Trail de 13 km<\/strong> (ambos com partida \u00e0s 09:00 e cronometragem por chip do <strong>Trilho Perdido<\/strong>), al\u00e9m da apraz\u00edvel <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:05. Com uma lota\u00e7\u00e3o exclusiva limitada a 300 participantes, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa, abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados, seguro desportivo, medalha finisher, banhos e a op\u00e7\u00e3o de um almo\u00e7o quente de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o no final.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li c